 for Spec Changes to Matrix","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/proposals/","line":14},{"title":"Client-Server API","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/client-server-api/","line":20},{"title":"Server-Server API","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/server-server-api/","line":21},{"title":"Application Service API","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/application-service-api/","line":22},{"title":"Identity Service API","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/identity-service-api/","line":23},{"title":"Push Gateway API","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/push-gateway-api/","line":24},{"title":"Room Versions","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/rooms/","line":25},{"title":"Olm & Megolm","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/olm-megolm/","line":26},{"title":"Appendices","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/appendices/","line":27},{"title":"overall architecture","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/#architecture","line":29},{"title":"Matrix API Viewer","target":"https://matrix.org/docs/api/","line":31},{"title":"RFC 2119","target":"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2119","line":71},{"title":"modules of the client-server API","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/client-server-api/#modules","line":73},{"title":"Proposals for Spec Changes to Matrix","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/proposals/","line":77},{"title":"‘Identifier Grammar’ in the appendices","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/appendices/#identifier-grammar","line":111},{"title":"package naming conventions","target":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Java_package#Package_naming_conventions","line":127},{"title":"‘Identifier Grammar’ in the appendices","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/appendices/#identifier-grammar","line":147},{"title":"‘Identifier Grammar’ in the appendices","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/appendices/#identifier-grammar","line":205},{"title":"Unix","target":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unix_time","line":255},{"title":"ECMAScript","target":"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/numbers-and-dates.html#sec-time-values-and-time-range","line":255},{"title":"deprecation policy","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/#deprecation-policy","line":266},{"title":"Matrix 1.0","target":"https://matrix.org/blog/2019/06/11/introducing-matrix-1-0-and-the-matrix-org-foundation/","line":286},{"title":"`GET /_matrix/client/versions`","target":"https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/client-server-api/#get_matrixclientversions","line":297},{"title":"Apache License, Version 2.0","target":"http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0","line":301}],"metadata":{"title":"Matrix Specification","source":"https://spec.matrix.org/latest/","author":null,"published":null,"created":"2026-04-28","description":"Matrix defines a set of open APIs for decentralised communication, suitable for securely publishing, persisting and subscribing to data over a global open federation of servers with no single point of control. Uses include Instant Messaging (IM), Voice over IP (VoIP) signalling, Internet of Things (IoT) communication, and bridging together existing communication silos - providing the basis of a new open real-time communication ecosystem.To propose a change to the Matrix Spec, see the explanations at Proposals for Spec Changes to Matrix.","date created":"Tuesday, April 28th 2026, 6:17:29 pm","date modified":"Tuesday, April 28th 2026, 6:18:08 pm"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[89,101],[107,109],[141,143],[151,187],[201,203],[211,223]],"key":"- Matrix Specification.md"},
